# Playwright's JSON reporter output (playwright.config.ts). Two names are used:
# `results-gating.json` and, via PLAYWRIGHT_JSON_OUTPUT_NAME, `results-informational.json`.
# Anyone who runs the harness locally — even a bare `--list` — leaves one behind.
#
# Not merely untidy: a real run's report carries test titles, error messages and any
# interpolated URL, and this suite talks to STAGING. A committed report is a small
# disclosure surface. It also blocked a push here, via a `git status -- e2e/` guard.
results-*.json
